ics"] "\n" [:option {:value "13"} "1952 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "14"} "1956 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "15"} "1960 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "16"} "1964 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "17"} "1968 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "18"} "1972 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "19"} "1976 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "20"} "1980 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "21"} "1984 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "22"} "1988 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "23"} "1992 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "24"} "1996 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "25"} "2000 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "26"} "2004 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "53"} "2008 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "65"} "2010 Summer Youth Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "54"} "2012 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "67"} "2014 Summer Youth Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "59"} "2016 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "69"} "2018 Summer Youth Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "61"} "2020 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "63"} "2024 Summer Olympics"]]] [:script {} "$('#sport_in_other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/editions/' + $('#sport_in_other_games_select').val() + '/sports/GAR'})"] "\n" [:h1 {} "Artistic Gymnastics at the 1932 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:table {:class "biodata"} "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Dates"] "\n" [:td {} "8 – 12 August 1932"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Medal Events"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Venues"] "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/300"} "Los Angeles Memorial Coliseum, Los Angeles, California"]] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n" [:div {:class "description"} "\n" [:p {} "The men’s gymnastics competitions in Los Angeles were the most extensive in Olympic history. In addition to the current Olympic Programme of " [:a {:href "/results/70104"} "floor exercises"] ", " [:a {:href "/results/70106"} "parallel bars"] ", " [:a {:href "/results/70107"} "horizontal bar"] ", " [:a {:href "/results/70108"} "rings"] ", " [:a {:href "/results/70109"} "pommelled horse"] ", and " [:a {:href "/results/70105"} "horse vault"] ", competitions in " [:a {:href "/results/70112"} "tumbling"] ", " [:a {:href "/results/70111"} "club swinging"] " and " [:a {:href "/results/70110"} "rope climbing"] " were also held. The floor exercises were held for the first time at the Olympic Games. " [:a {:href "/results/70092"} "Individual"] " and " [:a {:href "/results/70098"} "team all-around"] " competitions also took place. Thus, there were fully 11 men’s gymnastics events. Women had competed at the " [:a {:href "/results/70088"} "1928 Olympics in a team all-around"] " but did not compete in 1932."] "\n\n" [:p {} "All competitions were performed outdoors at the " [:a {:href "/venues/300"} "Los Angeles Memorial Coliseum"] ", partly in the evening hours, under floodlights. However, only seven countries took part: Finland, Hungary, Italy, Japan, and the United States with teams, as well as individual gymnasts from Mexico and Switzerland. The great star of the Games was " [:a {:href "/athletes/30532"} "Romeo Neri"] " from Italy, winning three gold medals. He was followed by the Hungarian " [:a {:href "/athletes/30408"} "István Pelle"] ", and " [:a {:href "/athletes/29833"} "Heikki Savolainen"] " from Finland."] "\n\n" [:p {} "One of the most unusual events was the demonstration by large groups of men and women on the evening of 10 August. Several different local groups, composed of Czechoslovak and Yugoslav Sokols, members of the Turnverein Germania, and Mexican and Japanese gymnasts, performed various gymnastic demonstrations in front of a large crowd. The Sokols performed to music while the Turnvereins did individual and group exercises, with the Mexicans performing allegorical exercises and dances (all their performers dressed as Montezuma’s warriors), and the Japanese demonstrated their native athletic activities, including ken-dō (fencing with bamboo sticks) and ju-jitsu. There were approximately 1,000 athletes in the demonstration."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70092"} "Individual All-Around, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "8 – 10 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "24"] "\n" [:td {} "5"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70098"} "Team All-Around, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "8 – 10 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "24"] "\n" [:td {} "5"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70104"} "Floor Exercise, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 8 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "25"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70105"} "Horse Vault, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "10 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "10"] "\n" [:td {} "4"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70106"} "Parallel Bars, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "15"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70107"} "Horizontal Bar, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "11 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70108"} "Rings, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70109"} "Pommelled Horse, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "11 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "10"] "\n" [:td {} "5"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70110"} "Rope Climbing, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "10 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "5"] "\n" [:td {} "2"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" 